    "sentence_translations": [
      "16 Years Old Bride and Bridegroom",
      "",
      "Recently, the news about a 16 year old bridegroom who married a 16 year old bride caught everyone's attention.",
      "Because in China, the legally marriageable age is 20 years old, and before this some parents do not even let their children date.",
      "So in the eyes of a lot of Chinese people, marriage at the age of 16 is not possible.",
      "",
      "These 16 year old bride and bridegroom say that it was only with their parents' support that they were able to get married.",
      "They plan on first holding a wedding ceremony, and then go make the marriage certificate when they have turned 20.",
      "",
      "One online user said, “Married at 16! I'm already 30 and I'm still a lousy single!”",
      "Another online user said: “You will spend 70 years together. Did you think this through, little friend?”"
    ]
